## 📌 Overview
Detects LLM hallucinations by generating an answer via Gemini, retrieving Wikipedia evidence with FAISS, classifying using DeBERTa NLI, and producing a final verdict — **Correct / Hallucinated / Uncertain** — with a confidence score.

## ⚙️ Tech Stack
`Python` `Gemini API` `FAISS` `DeBERTa-v3` `Sentence-Transformers` `TruthfulQA` `Streamlit` `Plotly`

## 🚀 Quick Start
```bash
git clone https://github.com/ritika-hackerone/Meta-LLM-Hallucination-Detection.git
cd Meta-LLM-Hallucination-Detection
python -m venv venv && venv\Scripts\activate
python setup.py
streamlit run app.py
```

